---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Beranda - KITA-KTP Pelayanan Inklusif">
  <div class="space-y-8 sm:space-y-12">
    <!-- Header Sapaan Ramah Masyarakat -->
    <section aria-labelledby="welcome-heading" class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4 pt-4 sm:pt-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-black border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 text-blue-800"
        :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15]!' : ''"
      >
        <span aria-hidden="true">🇮🇩</span>
        <span>Portal Administrasi Kependudukan Terpadu</span>
      </div>

      <h1 id="welcome-heading" class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Selamat Datang di Portal KITA-KTP
      </h1>

      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]/90' : 'text-slate-600'">
        Layanan kepengurusan KTP elektronik yang inklusif, tangkas, dan mudah diakses. Silakan pilih pintu layanan sesuai dengan kebutuhan Anda di bawah ini:
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- 3 Kartu Menu Pintu Layanan Utama Berukuran Besar (Mobile-First Touch Target) -->
    <section aria-label="Pilihan Pintu Layanan Utama" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">

      <!-- Pintu 1: Layanan Lansia (Aksen Amber/Oranye, Ikon Besar) -->
      <a
        href="/lansia"
        class="group relative rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border-2 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 flex flex-col justify-between"
        :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15] hover:bg-neutral-900 focus:ring-white' : 'border-amber-300 bg-linear-to-b from-amber-50 to-orange-50/60 hover:border-amber-400 hover:shadow-xl focus:ring-amber-400'"
      >
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div
              class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-4xl sm:text-5xl shadow-sm border"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-[#FACC15] text-black' : 'border-amber-200 bg-amber-100 text-amber-900'"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              🧓
            </div>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider border"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-amber-300 bg-amber-100 text-amber-900'"
            >
              Prioritas 60+
            </span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]' : 'text-slate-900'">
              Layanan Lansia
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-extrabold mt-1 text-amber-900" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]!' : ''">
              Petugas Rekam KTP Datang ke Rumah
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]/80' : 'text-slate-700'">
            Khusus warga lanjut usia. Formulir sangat ringkas, cukup tuliskan nama dan alamat untuk memanggil petugas jemput bola.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t flex items-center justify-between font-black text-sm" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15]/40 text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-amber-200 text-amber-900'">
          <span>Buka Pintu Lansia</span>
          <span class="text-lg transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true">➔</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Pintu 2: Layanan Disabilitas (Aksen Indigo/Ungu, Ikon Kursi Roda) -->
      <a
        href="/disabilitas"
        class="group relative rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border-2 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 flex flex-col justify-between"
        :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15] hover:bg-neutral-900 focus:ring-white' : 'border-purple-300 bg-linear-to-b from-purple-50 to-indigo-50/60 hover:border-purple-400 hover:shadow-xl focus:ring-purple-400'"
      >
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div
              class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-4xl sm:text-5xl shadow-sm border"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-[#FACC15] text-black' : 'border-purple-200 bg-purple-100 text-purple-900'"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              ♿
            </div>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider border"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-purple-300 bg-purple-100 text-purple-900'"
            >
              Akses Penuh
            </span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]' : 'text-slate-900'">
              Layanan Disabilitas
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-extrabold mt-1 text-purple-900" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]!' : ''">
              Pendamping Khusus & Jemput Bola
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]/80' : 'text-slate-700'">
            Fasilitas perekaman KTP ramah difabel netra, rungu, fisik, dan intelektual dengan pendampingan khusus ke rumah.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t flex items-center justify-between font-black text-sm" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15]/40 text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-purple-200 text-purple-900'">
          <span>Buka Pintu Disabilitas</span>
          <span class="text-lg transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true">➔</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Pintu 3: Layanan Umum (Aksen Biru, Ikon Gedung Kantor Kecamatan) -->
      <a
        href="/umum"
        class="group relative rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border-2 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 flex flex-col justify-between"
        :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15] hover:bg-neutral-900 focus:ring-white' : 'border-blue-300 bg-linear-to-b from-blue-50 to-sky-50/60 hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-xl focus:ring-blue-400'"
      >
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div
              class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-4xl sm:text-5xl shadow-sm border"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-[#FACC15] text-black' : 'border-blue-200 bg-blue-100 text-blue-900'"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              🏢
            </div>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider border"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-blue-300 bg-blue-100 text-blue-900'"
            >
              Masyarakat Umum
            </span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]' : 'text-slate-900'">
              Layanan Umum
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-extrabold mt-1 text-blue-900" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]!' : ''">
              Antrean Online Kantor Kecamatan
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]/80' : 'text-slate-700'">
            Bagi warga yang ingin membuat KTP baru atau cetak ulang KTP hilang/rusak dengan nomor antrean mandiri.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t flex items-center justify-between font-black text-sm" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15]/40 text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-blue-200 text-blue-900'">
          <span>Buka Pintu Umum</span>
          <span class="text-lg transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true">➔</span>
        </div>
      </a>

    </section>

    <!-- 1 Tombol Pintas di Bawah: "Cek Status / Lacak KTP" -->
    <section class="text-center pt-4">
      <div
        class="inline-block w-full max-w-xl p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-3xl border transition-all"
        :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-slate-300 bg-white shadow-md'"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div class="text-left space-y-1">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black">Sudah Pernah Mendaftar?</h3>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]/80' : 'text-slate-500'">
              Periksa tahapan verifikasi atau jadwal kunjungan petugas Anda.
            </p>
          </div>

          <a
            href="/lacak"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl font-black text-sm border transition-all focus:ring-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer shadow-sm"
            :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'bg-[#FACC15] text-black border-[#FACC15] hover:bg-yellow-300' : 'bg-slate-900 text-white border-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 focus:ring-slate-400'"
          >
            <span>🔍 Cek Status / Lacak KTP</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">➔</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
